## 6. Pricing configuration reference

Select the pricing model according to the merchant's commercial model.

| Pricing model | Conceptual use case | Example | Validation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Flat Fee | Fixed charge per billing period | Rp500,000 per month | Confirm configuration and frequency |
| Per Unit | Charge based on quantity | Rp10,000 per unit | Confirm quantity source and calculation |
| Tiered | Different rates across consumption bands | Rate varies by tier | Confirm exact calculation behavior |
| Volume | One applicable rate based on volume tier | All units charged at the achieved tier rate | Confirm exact calculation behavior |
| Stairstep | Fixed charge based on selected band | Fixed fee for a selected usage band | Confirm exact calculation behavior |
| Open Amount | Customer or merchant supplies an amount | Variable tuition or contribution | Confirm amount controls and limits |

These descriptions explain the commercial models. They do not replace validation of exact FlexiBill calculation rules.

### Pricing configuration decisions

Before go-live, establish:

- Base price.
- Currency.
- Billing frequency.
- Billing start date.
- Duration or number of charges.
- End condition.
- Tax treatment.
- Coupon or discount.
- Quantity source, if applicable.
- Rounding and adjustment rules.
- Treatment of changes during an active billing period.

## 7. Billing model decision matrix

| Requirement | Account Billing | Subscription Billing |
|---|---|---|
| Common customer billing calendar | Potential fit | Validate billing-anchor options |
| Individual recurring subscription | Evaluate against account model | Typical fit |
| Fixed monthly membership | Evaluate merchant workflow | Typical fit |
| Multiple services under one customer account | Validate account structure | Validate subscription relationships |
| Variable account-level charge | Validate amount source and calculation | Validate pricing and integration |
| Calendar-oriented billing | Intended consideration | Validate configured schedule |
| Subscription duration and renewal | Validate relationship | Core lifecycle consideration |

Do not select a billing model solely based on the word "monthly." The merchant's account structure, billing-date rules, and customer relationship determine the appropriate design.

