**Important interface distinctions**

- Pricing Table supports offer presentation and acquisition.
- Member Center supports customer/member identity and relationship management.
- Billing Portal supports the customer-facing billing experience where enabled.
- Payment Management governs the collection and payment outcome.

Do not assume these interfaces have identical capabilities or that all self-service functions are available.

## 9. Capability status register

Use these labels in internal documents, merchant proposals, and implementation plans.

| Status | Meaning | How to communicate |
|---|---|---|
| Available | Confirmed in the current product scope | May be described as available within its documented scope |
| Conditional | Available subject to merchant, country, channel, or configuration eligibility | State the conditions |
| Validation required | Evidence is insufficient to confirm availability or behavior | Confirm with Product / Engineering before commitment |
| Gap | Not currently supported in the validated scope | Do not sell as an existing capability |
| Future / Strategic | Product direction or proposed capability | Describe as a roadmap or concept, not released functionality |

