## 10. Integration model reference

Choose the operating model based on who owns billing logic and who initiates payment.

| Model | Merchant responsibility | FlexiBill / DOKU responsibility | Key validation |
|---|---|---|---|
| DOKU-hosted Billing Automation | Supply required merchant and customer configuration/data | Operate supported billing automation and payment workflows | Confirm supported configuration and ownership |
| H2H API and Webhook | Integrate APIs, manage relevant business logic and consume events | Provide documented API/payment capabilities | Confirm endpoints, events, status handling |
| Hybrid | Share responsibilities according to solution design | Operate the agreed FlexiBill and payment components | Document ownership at each step |
| Merchant Hosted Scheduler | Operate merchant-side scheduling according to the documented model | Process supported requests and payment operations | Validate eligibility, country scope, and exact integration |

### Integration decision questions

1. Who creates the billing obligation?
2. Who calculates the amount?
3. Who owns the customer and subscription record?
4. Who determines the billing schedule?
5. Who initiates payment?
6. Which system owns the final payment status?
7. How are status changes communicated?
8. How are duplicates and retries controlled?
9. Who reconciles payment outcomes?

**Country note:** Merchant Hosted Scheduler has been documented for Indonesian Business Account. Do not generalize this to Malaysia without validation.

